    <string name="first_run_title">First build — YTD-Lite 0.1.0-alpha</string>
    <string name="first_run_message">This is the first version, so straight to the point.

YTD-Lite downloads video and audio from a link. It runs on yt-dlp — I did not write my own engine and I am not going to. Paste a link, pick a format, tap “Download” — the file lands in the folder you chose (Downloads by default).

Version 0.1.0-alpha. That means half of the small things are not finished yet, and some are definitely broken. If something does not work)</string>
